        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Today, young people copy the style and behaviour of celebrities such as actors, musicians and sports stars. Do you think this is a positive or a negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrmYdY6zwoyx8vxiUZflhgeog1e\"><em><strong>Today, young people copy the style and behaviour of celebrities such as actors, musicians and sports stars. Do you think this is a positive or a negative development?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Celebrity Influence on Youth Behaviors and Styles <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Celebrity Influence on Youth Behaviors and Styles cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Ng&agrave;y nay, giới trẻ bắt chước phong c&aacute;ch v&agrave; h&agrave;nh vi của những người nổi tiếng như diễn vi&ecirc;n, nhạc sĩ v&agrave; c&aacute;c ng&ocirc;i sao thể thao.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Celebrity Influence on Youth Behaviors and Styles v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDdydaFWOoBhJ0x8V5rlxBR8ghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">imitate the fashion choices and actions <em>(bắt chước c&aacute;c lựa chọn thời trang v&agrave; h&agrave;nh động)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDdydaFWOoBhJ0x8V5rlxBR8ghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">celebrities &rarr; famous figures&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực hơn l&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực của xu hướng n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UeCkdNayooZiasxvZUwlLX1Ag6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:&nbsp;</strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, c&oacute; một số hậu quả ti&ecirc;u cực khi thanh thiếu ni&ecirc;n noi gương những người nổi tiếng.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D85ydGvYPopsOexdQSzlI7Yvggf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BkBXdDtcooR4lqxVdqTl04DTg3e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Giới trẻ c&oacute; thể ph&aacute;t triển <em>những ti&ecirc;u chuẩn sắc đẹp phi thực tế (unrealistic beauty standards)</em> v&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c vấn đề về h&igrave;nh ảnh cơ thể (body image issues)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMONdXgL7oahZdxmKklljZSzgyf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Nhiều thanh thiếu ni&ecirc;n cảm thấy tự ti khi so s&aacute;nh bản th&acirc;n với những người nổi tiếng, điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể dẫn đến lo lắng, <em>l&ograve;ng tự trọng thấp (low self-esteem)</em>, v&agrave; thậm ch&iacute; l&agrave; <em>rối loạn ăn uống (eating disorders)</em>. Vấn đề n&agrave;y đặc biệt nghi&ecirc;m trọng khi <em>những bức ảnh chỉnh sửa nhiều (heavily edited photos)</em> tr&ecirc;n mạng x&atilde; hội khiến những ti&ecirc;u chuẩn n&agrave;y c&agrave;ng kh&oacute; đạt được hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUm7dcHfLo20hgxySC7lpBHxgjd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTerdTD1hoUGW0xyA5FlzI0qgHf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Một số người nổi tiếng thể hiện <em>những h&agrave;nh vi kh&ocirc;ng ph&ugrave; hợp (inappropriate behaviors)</em> m&agrave; giới trẻ c&oacute; thể bắt chước.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UD28dt0yGouDLExLLCOlmzSlgDh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> V&iacute; dụ, một số nhạc sĩ hoặc diễn vi&ecirc;n khuyến kh&iacute;ch việc tiệc t&ugrave;ng qu&aacute; mức, <em>sử dụng chất k&iacute;ch th&iacute;ch (substance use)</em>, hoặc h&agrave;nh vi liều lĩnh, v&agrave; <em>những thanh thiếu ni&ecirc;n dễ bị ảnh hưởng (impressionable teenagers)</em> c&oacute; thể coi những h&agrave;nh động n&agrave;y l&agrave; h&agrave;o nho&aacute;ng v&agrave; c&oacute; thể chấp nhận được.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: T</strong>r&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y g&acirc;y ra</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:&nbsp;</strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin chắc rằng những lợi &iacute;ch của xu hướng n&agrave;y quan trọng hơn.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeX1d74K2oszJwxVwgLlOlubghg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkeldoaoMokRxRxYECWljT3dg3g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Lợi &iacute;ch ch&iacute;nh l&agrave; <em>những h&igrave;nh mẫu người nổi tiếng (celebrity role models)</em> c&oacute; thể th&uacute;c đẩy giới trẻ cải thiện bản th&acirc;n.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0VjdHScloZpHixcULslcAmcgdc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason</strong>: Những người nổi tiếng th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng thường chia sẻ h&agrave;nh tr&igrave;nh l&agrave;m việc chăm chỉ v&agrave; ki&ecirc;n tr&igrave; của họ, điều n&agrave;y chứng minh rằng sự cống hiến v&agrave; nỗ lực dẫn đến th&agrave;nh tựu. Điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể truyền cảm hứng cho thanh thiếu ni&ecirc;n <em>đặt ra c&aacute;c mục ti&ecirc;u c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (set personal goals)</em>, học tập hoặc chơi thể thao chăm chỉ hơn, v&agrave; ph&aacute;t triển <em>đạo đức l&agrave;m việc (work ethic)</em> mạnh mẽ hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OF6RdYATso7Jyzxkud3lxrSRgLc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx3Ud3ZRuojDvLxy5F2lhSbjgaf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Việc theo đuổi phong c&aacute;ch của người nổi tiếng cho ph&eacute;p giới trẻ thể hiện sự s&aacute;ng tạo của m&igrave;nh.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TCtCdUbRzotNVbxyv1blviIsgbg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Khi thanh thiếu ni&ecirc;n thử nghiệm với c&aacute;c phong c&aacute;ch v&agrave; xu hướng kh&aacute;c nhau, điều n&agrave;y gi&uacute;p họ kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; những <em>sở th&iacute;ch c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (personal preferences)</em> v&agrave; x&acirc;y dựng sự tự tin trong việc <em>thể hiện bản th&acirc;n (self-expression)</em>, đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một phần thiết yếu trong việc ph&aacute;t triển bản sắc của họ trong tuổi vị th&agrave;nh ni&ecirc;n. Sự kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; như vậy gi&uacute;p họ <em>trau dồi phong c&aacute;ch độc đ&aacute;o ri&ecirc;ng (cultivate their own unique style)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZJ5diZ6OoQkltxv3m6lz9I7g5b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">unrealistic expectations and inappropriate conduct <em>(kỳ vọng phi thực tế v&agrave; h&agrave;nh vi kh&ocirc;ng ph&ugrave; hợp)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZJ5diZ6OoQkltxv3m6lz9I7g5b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">motivation for self-improvement and creative self-expression <em>(động lực để cải thiện bản th&acirc;n v&agrave; sự thể hiện s&aacute;ng tạo)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2988,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>It is increasingly common for young people to imitate the fashion choices and actions of famous figures in entertainment and sports. Although this trend can lead to certain drawbacks, I believe it is largely a positive development.</p>",
            "question_id": 40768,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2989,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>Admittedly, there are some negative consequences when teenagers model themselves after celebrities.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">One concern is that young people may develop unrealistic beauty standards and body image issues. Many teenagers feel inadequate when comparing themselves to celebrities, which can lead to anxiety, low self-esteem, and even eating disorders as they struggle to achieve an impossible ideal. This problem is particularly severe in today's digital age, where heavily edited photos on social media platforms make these standards even more unattainable.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Another issue is that some celebrities exhibit inappropriate behaviors that young people might imitate. For instance, certain musicians or actors promote excessive partying, substance use, or reckless behavior, and impressionable teenagers may view these actions as glamorous and acceptable, potentially normalizing conduct that could harm their health and future prospects.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 40768,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2990,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I am convinced that the benefits of this trend are more significant.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">The main advantage is that celebrity role models can motivate young people to improve themselves. Successful celebrities often share their journey of hard work and perseverance, which demonstrates that dedication and effort lead to achievement. This can inspire teenagers to set personal goals, work harder in their studies or sports, and develop a stronger work ethic that will benefit them throughout their lives.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, following celebrity styles allows young people to express their creativity. When teenagers experiment with different looks and trends, this helps them discover their personal preferences and build confidence in self-expression, which is an essential part of developing their identity during adolescence. Such exploration enables them to understand what suits them best and cultivate their own unique style.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 40768,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2991,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, while imitating celebrities can lead to some problems related to unrealistic expectations and inappropriate conduct, I believe the positive impacts, in terms of motivation for self-improvement and creative self-expression, are far more substantial.</p>",
